OL,3,APriest killed and four injured in knife
OL,4,Aattack at Polish abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priest has been killed and four other
OL,7,Fpeople injured in a knife attack in
OL,8,Fsouth-east Poland, officials have said.
OL,10,FA 31-year-old Ukrainian man was
OL,11,Farrested after the stabbings on the
OL,12,Fgrounds of a Catholic abbey in the town
OL,13,Fof JarosEBaw.
OL,15,FPolish President Karol Nawrocki said
OL,16,FThursday's attack "has shaken us all
OL,17,Fand demands a firm response from the
OL,18,Fstate", while his Ukrainian counterpart
OL,19,FVolodymyr Zelensky said "we are shocked
OL,20,Fby this evil".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
