OL,3,APriest killed and four injured in knife
OL,4,Aattack at Polish abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports in Polish media said the
OL,7,Fattacker first injured a priest in a
OL,8,Fnearby cafe, and then another four
OL,9,Fpeople inside the abbey itself. A
OL,10,Fpolice investigation into the
OL,11,Fattacker's motives is now under way.
